k): scope secret scanning to request locations by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1666\n* fix(filesystem): keep surviving macos hard links writable by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1668\n### CI\n* ci(release): categorize notes and filter mintlify noise by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1659\n### Maintenance\n* chore: refresh npm lockfile after v0.7.3 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1652\n* chore(release): bump all packages to 0.7.4 by @toksdotdev in https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/pull/1665\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/superradcompany/microsandbox/compare/v0.7.3...v0.7.4","mentions_count":2}
